        "title": "Fix SQL query for max referral check",
        "summary": "Corrects `hasMaxedReferrals` logic in `common/src/util/server/referral.ts`. Replaces complex join/groupBy query with direct count check and separate user lookup to ensure accurate limit detection and referral code retrieval.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-15T18:42:51.622Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "When you check if you've hit your referral limit, the system now counts your referrals directly instead of running a complicated combined lookup that sometimes gave the wrong answer. You can tell this worked if your referral page now correctly shows your personal referral code and link, or stops you once your referral cap is reached, instead of showing a blank or letting you over-refer. The change is live today.",
