        "title": "Fix referral text formatting",
        "summary": "Corrects JSX text rendering in `web/src/app/onboard/page.tsx` by removing stray backticks from the referral success message. Updates copy in `web/src/app/referrals/page.tsx` to clarify login requirement for generating a referral code. Scope limited to Web UI text components. No logic or API changes.",
