        "title": "WebSocket timeout raised to 10s; nodemodules ignored",
        "summary": "WebSocket client timeout increased from 5000ms to 10000ms in `common/src/websockets/websocket-client.ts`. Project file tree now ignores `node_modules` by default in `common/src/project-file-tree.ts`. `make` added to `SKIPPED_TERMINAL_COMMANDS` in `common/src/constants.ts`. File size limit for project files reduced from 5MB to 1MB in `npm-app/src/project-files.ts`.",
