      "eli5": {
        "text": "The assistant will now wait up to 10 seconds for a response over its live connection before giving up, instead of 5 seconds. It also stops listing the large folder of downloaded helper tools that every project carries, so file listings stay focused on your own code. Files it reads for you are now capped at 1 megabyte instead of 5, and a few internal bookkeeping commands have been quietly skipped. These adjustments are live today.",
